			rgCommunityRecommendations: [{"appid":5335510,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238408934","appid":5335510,"accountid":98398412,"playtime_at_review":665,"review_text":"Has conveyor belts. Good game. I see people complaining about the upgrades being for each individual player. As it stands, you can fully max out after clearing less than 1% of the moon, so there's plenty of dust for each...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198058664140\/recommended\/5335510\/","votes_up":12},{"recommendationid":"238386308","appid":5335510,"accountid":88344848,"playtime_at_review":372,"review_text":"6 hours in and really enjoying the game and want to keep playing, can only speak for solo gameplay but haven't run into any major issues as of yet!!","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198048610576\/recommended\/5335510\/","votes_up":3},{"recommendationid":"238375256","appid":5335510,"accountid":121035937,"playtime_at_review":180,"review_text":"Overall a great game. The art, music and style of the game are relaxing and allows you to actually play the game without feeling overwhelmed instantly. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198081301665\/recommended\/5335510\/","votes_up":3}]},{"appid":3259780,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238376333","appid":3259780,"accountid":1026140919,"playtime_at_review":391,"review_text":"As a doctor in my 30s, my life mostly revolves around long shifts, endless responsibilities, and taking care of other people. But somehow, this game made me feel like a kid again. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198986406647\/recommended\/3259780\/","votes_up":242},{"recommendationid":"238420061","appid":3259780,"accountid":82118185,"playtime_at_review":1029,"review_text":"I loved FFBE, always said they needed to make it a single player game story. So glad they have, at least the first chapter. I'm hoping they add the rest.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198042383913\/recommended\/3259780\/","votes_up":12},{"recommendationid":"238406596","appid":3259780,"accountid":17424391,"playtime_at_review":356,"review_text":"Straight nostalgia from all the other titles is good. story is a bit pg 13 and monologue is samesies, but the essence of FF is there!","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197977690119\/recommended\/3259780\/","votes_up":9},{"recommendationid":"238417505","appid":3259780,"accountid":160194311,"playtime_at_review":277,"review_text":"OMG it's perfect! The sounds, the graphics, the music, the voice acting. Everything reminds me of Final Fantasy. I haven't felt like this about a game since FF7. Thank you Square Enix.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198120460039\/recommended\/3259780\/","votes_up":14},{"recommendationid":"238412552","appid":3259780,"accountid":47615454,"playtime_at_review":431,"review_text":"Game is great, Visions are fun, artstyle is really nice, HD-2D games are love, resonance attacks are pretty cool, what more do you want? closest thing to old school FF with some fanservice added on top","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198007881182\/recommended\/3259780\/","votes_up":5},{"recommendationid":"238430957","appid":3259780,"accountid":273169996,"playtime_at_review":286,"review_text":"This game is a love-letter to the NES\/SNES era of Final Fantasy. The HD-2D presentation is amazing, the soundtrack is legendary, and the battle system and gameplay at Expert difficulty is awesome. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198233435724\/recommended\/3259780\/","votes_up":3},{"recommendationid":"238441557","appid":3259780,"accountid":227211481,"playtime_at_review":71,"review_text":"Final Fantasy Resonance is a Priceless Gem and a Masterpiece. My heart is overflowing and has come back to life. There are some things in life that have to be felt to be understood. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198187477209\/recommended\/3259780\/","votes_up":2}]},{"appid":2087540,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238406415","appid":2087540,"accountid":159298764,"playtime_at_review":790,"review_text":"I really enjoy escape from playtime actually, I feel like far too many people are ripping on it so early on when i'm just having a blast playing it with my friends, I think people comparing it to project playtime is unfair...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198119564492\/recommended\/2087540\/","votes_up":19}]},{"appid":2000950,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238383854","appid":2000950,"accountid":1266271618,"playtime_at_review":297,"review_text":"My first Call of Duty game in the Modern Warfare(Campaign) series, and MAN, WHAT AN EXPERIENCE!! The cinematics are absolutely CRAZY!! The environments, the attention to detail, and the way everything is presented genuinely...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199226537346\/recommended\/2000950\/","votes_up":9}]},{"appid":4094350,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238394040","appid":4094350,"accountid":181830842,"playtime_at_review":165,"review_text":"Hi most of this is not for all the people that have left negative reviews , they obviously couldnt use the phone in game...as for performance and graphics fps and bugs ...bought the game despite seeing the many negative...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198142096570\/recommended\/4094350\/","votes_up":7}]},{"appid":3486530,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238375792","appid":3486530,"accountid":74548503,"playtime_at_review":598,"review_text":"It feels like a PS2 action brawler in a good way. Modern and rather interestingly stylized graphics and a roguelite paintjob with surprisingly fun progression makes it a must buy... on a small sale. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198034814231\/recommended\/3486530\/","votes_up":17}]},{"appid":2638890,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238384201","appid":2638890,"accountid":1266271618,"playtime_at_review":1717,"review_text":"What an amazing game!! Capcom really cooked with this one! First of all, the combat is CRAZY GOOD!! Especially the parrying and Issen mechanic. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199226537346\/recommended\/2638890\/","votes_up":10}]},{"appid":3905010,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238376700","appid":3905010,"accountid":118367476,"playtime_at_review":63,"review_text":"I've only played for a little at the moment but I overall love Kairosoft games and this is another one I'm really enjoying. It's so cute and I love seeing the characters in Kairosoft's style. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198078633204\/recommended\/3905010\/","votes_up":7},{"recommendationid":"238423446","appid":3905010,"accountid":234689565,"playtime_at_review":514,"review_text":"This game has it's issues, the font and weird dialogue pacing stuff being a major one. But i can deal with it and i enjoy it a lot.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198194955293\/recommended\/3905010\/","votes_up":3}]},{"appid":3960600,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238396030","appid":3960600,"accountid":52469472,"playtime_at_review":102,"review_text":"Saying 'I recommend this' with a very big asterisk next to it. If you're looking for immersive Warrior cats gameplay, this really isn't it right now - but if you want to be a warrior that's dealing with some bits of RNG,...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198012735200\/recommended\/3960600\/","votes_up":96},{"recommendationid":"238402071","appid":3960600,"accountid":103234740,"playtime_at_review":164,"review_text":"I was honestly shocked seeing so many negative reviews of the game within just an hour or two of launch. But some things, I understand. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198063500468\/recommended\/3960600\/","votes_up":47},{"recommendationid":"238398722","appid":3960600,"accountid":356519890,"playtime_at_review":146,"review_text":"I think people are being a little harsh on this game. I get it, it's not the best looking or the most intense thing ever but also Warriors is beginning to be catered towards children more than us who were children reading...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198316785618\/recommended\/3960600\/","votes_up":120},{"recommendationid":"238405643","appid":3960600,"accountid":871677672,"playtime_at_review":270,"review_text":"I think people are being a little too harsh on this game, honestly. I've been having a TON of fun with it, and I feel like a lot of the negative reviews are judging it for things it was never really trying to be. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198831943400\/recommended\/3960600\/","votes_up":14},{"recommendationid":"238440957","appid":3960600,"accountid":292237290,"playtime_at_review":468,"review_text":"Despite seeing loads of people not liking the game, I've had fun with what I've played so far :D I finished ThunderClan's story and I plan on doing the other three! Is it the best gameplay? No. Is it the best writing? No. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198252503018\/recommended\/3960600\/","votes_up":7},{"recommendationid":"238418016","appid":3960600,"accountid":145648509,"playtime_at_review":136,"review_text":"Well, I\u2019m enjoying myself, lol. It\u2019s far from perfect, but I still think it\u2019s good and worth what I paid. That said, there are things I wish would get updated. Let me turn off motion blur, for starters? ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198105914237\/recommended\/3960600\/","votes_up":5},{"recommendationid":"238401580","appid":3960600,"accountid":169557814,"playtime_at_review":136,"review_text":"is this game perfect? not by a long shot is it everything i would have wanted as a kid? absolutely if you turn your brain off, and let yourself get absorbed into the environment and music, its a lot of fun","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198129823542\/recommended\/3960600\/","votes_up":5},{"recommendationid":"238418120","appid":3960600,"accountid":169022777,"playtime_at_review":458,"review_text":"I don\u2019t understand how so many people are downvoting this game. I personally LOVE this game and love the fact that we have an official Warrior Cat game now other than WCEU on Roblox. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198129288505\/recommended\/3960600\/","votes_up":3},{"recommendationid":"238412340","appid":3960600,"accountid":339559606,"playtime_at_review":308,"review_text":"So, I'm not a person who leaves reviews on games. But this is something I've been waiting for since I was 15 years old, and after spending a little over 5 hours in game, I paused to take a break and wandered back to see how...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198299825334\/recommended\/3960600\/","votes_up":14},{"recommendationid":"238399379","appid":3960600,"accountid":183848399,"playtime_at_review":191,"review_text":"Honestly, I am rather impressed with this game. For a first game based on a series that has only ever canonically been a book series, I am really impressed with this being a first attempt. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198144114127\/recommended\/3960600\/","votes_up":3},{"recommendationid":"238426154","appid":3960600,"accountid":1132093430,"playtime_at_review":163,"review_text":"cloudtail and brightheart are so freaking cute!!!!!!! i love this game, im happy to finish the rest of the stories and get all the achievements. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199092359158\/recommended\/3960600\/","votes_up":4}]},{"appid":3469910,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238404931","appid":3469910,"accountid":51599917,"playtime_at_review":2376,"review_text":"I like it. It's not polished, it's not ready, but I still like it. Each day there is patch from devs, and that is the reason why I believe it can be good one. You may wait a bit, but I would not remove it from wishlist.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198011865645\/recommended\/3469910\/","votes_up":6}]},{"appid":2828710,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238393413","appid":2828710,"accountid":243026362,"playtime_at_review":6258,"review_text":"Valor Mortis has been a pleasant surprise for me, I wasn't going to buy it but it was gifted to me so I decided to jump right in and I am really glad I didn't wait. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198203292090\/recommended\/2828710\/","votes_up":15},{"recommendationid":"238414513","appid":2828710,"accountid":120247267,"playtime_at_review":1378,"review_text":"Valor Mortis is actually so damn good. I went into this game not knowing what to expect, but the combat really grew on me. The parrying, dodging and overall feel of the fights make every encounter satisfying, especially when...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198080512995\/recommended\/2828710\/","votes_up":5}]},{"appid":1713730,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238420976","appid":1713730,"accountid":258599881,"playtime_at_review":207,"review_text":"Let me just sum this up real fast and say this is the absolute best Metroidvania game since Super Metroid on the SNES, with Ori and the Blind Forest as a very close second. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198218865609\/recommended\/1713730\/","votes_up":4},{"recommendationid":"238405022","appid":1713730,"accountid":26640162,"playtime_at_review":240,"review_text":"So far, so good. I've beaten the first boss after stumbling across it too early, and turned my butt around and explored elsewhere til I got more health upgrades and beefed up my starter gun a little more. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197986905890\/recommended\/1713730\/","votes_up":4},{"recommendationid":"238430485","appid":1713730,"accountid":104821478,"playtime_at_review":1090,"review_text":"A 10\/10 Metroidvania, it wears Metroid as a badge of honor and it exceeds the call of duty that is needed to wear that badge, it has earned every minute I played and I am thoroughly hooked, and curious to see that this devs...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198065087206\/recommended\/1713730\/","votes_up":3}]}],
